   "scene": "c01-rule",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "لِمَاذَا",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "hl:لِمَاذَا"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-rule-13",
   "scene": "c01-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "These endings never change. The words are fixed.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "hl:These never change."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-01",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Three tips. First, there are two words for what.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "tip:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-02",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مَا",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:مَا"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-03",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مَاذَا",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "hl:مَاذَا"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-04",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The short one is usual before a noun. What is your name?",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:usual before a noun"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-05",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مَا اسْمُكَ؟",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "hl:مَا اسْمُكَ؟"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-06",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The long one is usual before a verb. What did you write?",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:usual before a verb"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-07",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مَاذَا كَتَبْتَ؟",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "hl:مَاذَا كَتَبْتَ؟"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-08",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Second, the word for how many.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "tip:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-09",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كَمْ",
   "pause": 0.35,
   "cues": [
    "hl:كَمْ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-10",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "After it comes one noun with tanween fatha. How many books?",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:tanween fatha"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-11",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كَمْ كِتَابًا؟",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "hl:كَمْ كِتَابًا؟"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-12",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The noun is singular, even though the meaning is plural.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-13",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Third, the word for why.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "tip:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-14",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "لِمَاذَا",
   "pause": 0.35,
   "cues": [
    "hl:لِمَاذَا"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-15",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It is made of two parts. The first part means for.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-16",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "لِ",
   "pause": 0.35,
   "cues": [
    "hl:لِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-17",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The second is the word for what.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-18",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مَاذَا",
   "pause": 0.35,
   "cues": [
    "hl:مَاذَا"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-tips-19",
   "scene": "c01-tips",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Together they mean: for what?",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "hl:for what?"
   ]
  }
 ]
}